## 3. What "Put You On" is (product context)

Music discovery app. User logs in with Spotify → we pull their top tracks → audio
embeddings + nearest-neighbor search → hand back **10 fresh song recs daily** (hard
10/day limit). No infinite feed. The whole pitch: *a friend who puts you on to new music.*

Stack: **Next.js 16 (app router) + React 19 + Tailwind v4** (CSS-first `@theme`, zero
radius / sharp corners today). Animation lib `motion` is already installed. Existing
screens:

- `src/app/page.tsx` — landing (login entry)
- `src/app/dashboard/page.tsx` — daily recs (`song-rec-carousel`)
- `src/app/profile/page.tsx` — Spotify profile + top-tracks "taste" page
- `src/app/logout/page.tsx`, `src/app/callback/page.tsx`
- `src/components/.../navbar-component-01` — shared nav
- `src/components/spotify-login-button.tsx`, `song-rec-carousel.tsx`
- `src/app/globals.css` — current editorial design system (to be replaced)

